      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Join Prison Escape\n\n3. Pick up several of the guns & weapons (LMG, SMG, M4, Pistols, Knife)\n\n4. Try throwing them, they will simply drop to the ground.\n\nNote: Someone said it also happens in other games potentially: Infected, possibly Murder.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1342] Throwing some physical objects does not work in some worlds.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6511c57dbca976095e7da0df",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Note that Prison Escape and Infected use a common method of pickup \"stabilization\" by setting Rigidbody.isKinematic = true while held, then back to false on drop. It would be nice if VRChat fixed pickup jitter on their end so we don't need to do this.",
